          The Helix Center is a 501(c)(3) tax-exempt non-profit organization. For over a decade,
          we have provided completely free access to world-class intellectual programming &mdash;
          from Nobel laureate conversations to poetry readings &mdash; supported entirely by the
          generosity of donors who believe in the power of interdisciplinary inquiry.
        </p>
        <p>
          Your contribution directly supports the curation of groundbreaking roundtable discussions,
          professional video production and archiving, live-streaming infrastructure for global access,
          and educational outreach programs.
        </p>
        <p>
